WEBVTT

00:07:29.147 --> 00:07:31.386
Ali 1990.-ih

00:07:31.386 --> 00:07:33.082
istraživanja su pokazala,

00:07:33.082 --> 00:07:35.819
na čelu s Elizabeth 
Gould sa Princetona


00:07:35.819 --> 00:07:39.154
istraživanja su pokazala 
dokaze o neurogoenezi,


00:07:39.154 --> 00:07:41.212
stvaranju novih neurona

00:07:41.212 --> 00:07:44.281
u odraslom mozgu sisavca,

00:07:44.281 --> 00:07:45.865
prvo u olfaktornom bulbusu,

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:47.946
odgovornom za njuh,

00:07:47.946 --> 00:07:49.985
zatim u hipokampusu

00:07:49.985 --> 00:07:52.029
uključenom u kratkotrajno pamćenje,

00:07:52.029 --> 00:07:55.312
i naposljetku u amigdali.

00:07:55.312 --> 00:07:57.088
Kako bih razumio

00:07:57.088 --> 00:07:59.047
ove procese,

00:07:59.047 --> 00:08:01.936
napustio sam psihopate i pridružio se laboratoriju na Oxfordu